	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/campaign_ai/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The campaign's Marines and Covenant fight as units, an Elite or a sergeant leading each through drills. From the next map; off: the stock AI. On the host of a campaign or co-op game only."/>
		<string text="Trained models choose the drills and each soldier's way of fighting; off: the scripted drill. From the next map."/>
		<string text="Soldiers outside a unit's drill choose their own way of fighting."/>
		<string text="How freely units choose among the drills they rate well. Best: always the best one."/>
		<string text="Commanded soldiers hold their nerve: fewer panics, berserk charges and lone pursuits."/>
		<string text="Soldiers choose targets by threat: what is hurting them, Elites first."/>
		<string text="How far from its leader, in world units, a soldier is still in its unit."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="How widely the AI's shots spread: 1 as the stock game; less is sharper."/>
		<string text="Wider on Easy, sharper on Heroic and Legendary."/>
		<string text="Aim worse at a target moving fast, and from a vehicle as it swerves."/>
		<string text="How fast the Marines fire, against the stock game's 1."/>
	</strings>
